<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>Vipin Shastri | Data &amp; MIS Professional</title>
<meta name="description" content="Data & MIS professional skilled in Advanced Excel, SQL and Power BI, specializing in operational reporting and workflow automation.">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#0c111b">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bricolage+Grotesque:wght@400;600;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<script>document.documentElement.classList.add('js')</script>
<style>
:root{--bg:#0c111b;--pan:#131a28;--line:#243049;--tx:#e8ecf4;--mu:#8f9bb3;--ac:#ffd23f}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth;scroll-padding-top:70px}
body{background:var(--bg);color:var(--tx);font:400 1rem/1.65 'Bricolage Grotesque',system-ui,sans-serif;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}
body::before{content:"";position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:-1;background:linear-gradient(rgba(143,155,179,.07) 1px,transparent 1px) 0 0/96px 34px,linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(143,155,179,.07) 1px,transparent 1px) 0 0/96px 34px}
a{color:inherit}
a:focus-visible,.btn:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--ac);outline-offset:3px}
.wrap{max-width:1060px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 22px}
section{padding:90px 0}
h1{font-size:clamp(3.6rem,14vw,8rem);line-height:.9;letter-spacing:-.045em;font-weight:800}
h2{font-size:clamp(1.9rem,5vw,2.8rem);letter-spacing:-.03em;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:30px}
h3{font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:600}
.top{position:fixed;inset:0 0 auto;z-index:9;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;padding:10px 22px;background:rgba(12,17,27,.85);backdrop-filter:blur(10px);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.logo{font-weight:800;font-size:1.2rem;text-decoration:none}
.logo span{color:var(--ac)}
.fx{display:flex;flex:1;max-width:330px;min-width:0;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:4px;font:.78rem ui-monospace,Menlo,Consolas,monospace}
.fx i{padding:3px 10px;color:var(--ac);border-right:1px solid var(--line)}
.fx code{padding:3px 10px;color:var(--mu);white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden}
.top nav{margin-left:auto;display:flex;gap:20px;overflow-x:auto}
.top nav a{color:var(--mu);text-decoration:none;font-size:.92rem;white-space:nowrap}
.top nav a:hover{color:var(--ac)}
.hero{min-height:100svh;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr;gap:44px;align-items:center;padding-top:110px;padding-bottom:50px}
.cell{display:inline-block;position:relative;margin-top:26px;padding:6px 16px;border:2px solid var(--ac);font-weight:600;font-size:1.15rem}
.cell::after{content:"";position:absolute;right:-6px;bottom:-6px;width:9px;height:9px;background:var(--ac);border:1px solid var(--bg)}
.lead{color:var(--mu);font-size:1.15rem;max-width:33em;margin:28px 0 30px}
.btn{display:inline-block;padding:12px 22px;border-radius:4px;background:var(--ac);color:#0c111b;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;margin:0 10px 10px 0}
.btn.ghost{background:none;color:var(--tx);border:1px solid var(--line)}
.btn.ghost:hover{border-color:var(--ac);color:var(--ac)}
.sheet{background:var(--pan);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden}
.sheet .r{display:grid;grid-template-columns:82px 1fr;gap:12px;align-items:center;padding:13px 16px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);font-size:.92rem}
.sheet .sh{background:#1b2438;color:var(--mu);font-weight:600;border-top:0}
.sheet b{height:14px;width:0;background:var(--ac);transition:width 1.3s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1)}
.sheet.on b{width:var(--w)}
.sheet small{display:block;padding:10px 16px;color:var(--mu);font-size:.8rem;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.two{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.3fr 1fr;gap:38px;align-items:start}
.two p{font-size:1.15rem}
.ticks{list-style:none;display:grid;gap:12px}
.ticks li{padding-left:26px;position:relative}
.ticks li::before{content:"✓";position:absolute;left:0;color:var(--ac);font-weight:800}
.path{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto 1fr;gap:16px;align-items:center;margin-top:46px}
.path div:not(.arr){background:var(--pan);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;padding:20px}
.path b{display:block;font-size:1.2rem;color:var(--ac)}
.path span{color:var(--mu);font-size:.95rem}
.arr{font-size:1.6rem;color:var(--ac)}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(290px,1fr));gap:16px}
.card{background:var(--pan);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;padding:22px}
.card:nth-child(3n+2){border-radius:14px}
.card h3{margin-bottom:8px}
.card p{font-size:.92rem;color:var(--mu);margin-top:10px}
.card p em,.roles h3+ul{font-style:normal}
.card p em{display:block;font-weight:600;font-size:.82rem;color:var(--ac)}
.card p.adv{color:var(--tx)}
.roles{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px;margin-top:16px}
.roles ul{list-style:none;display:grid;gap:9px;margin-top:14px;font-size:.93rem;color:var(--mu)}
.roles li{padding-left:16px;position:relative}
.roles li::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:.7em;width:6px;height:2px;background:var(--ac)}
.proj{display:grid;gap:12px;margin-bottom:16px}
.proj .hd{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:12px}
.proj h3{font-size:1.4rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.02em}
.f{font-size:.8rem;font-weight:600;color:#0c111b;background:var(--ac);padding:1px 10px;border-radius:99px}
.proj .ob{color:var(--tx);font-size:1rem;margin:0}
.proj ul{list-style:none;display:grid;gap:7px;color:var(--mu);font-size:.93rem}
.proj li{padding-left:20px;position:relative}
.proj li::before{content:"›";position:absolute;left:0;color:var(--ac);font-weight:800}
.tl{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}
.tl span{font-size:.8rem;padding:3px 12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:99px;color:var(--mu)}
.links a{font-size:.88rem;margin-right:18px;text-decoration:none;border-bottom:1px solid var(--ac)}
.links a:hover,.host a:hover{color:var(--ac)}
.host{color:var(--mu);margin-top:26px}
.host a{color:var(--tx);border-bottom:1px solid var(--ac);text-decoration:none}
.contact{text-align:center}
.contact h2{font-size:clamp(2.2rem,8vw,4.6rem);line-height:1}
.contact p{color:var(--mu);margin-bottom:26px}
.mail{display:block;font-size:clamp(1.1rem,4.5vw,1.9rem);font-weight:600;margin-bottom:26px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--ac);word-break:break-all}
footer{padding:26px 22px;text-align:center;color:var(--mu);font-size:.85rem;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.js .rv{opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px);transition:opacity .8s,transform .8s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1)}
.js .rv.in{opacity:1;transform:none}
@media(max-width:820px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;min-height:auto;padding-top:120px}.fx{display:none}}
@media(max-width:720px){.two,.path,.roles{grid-template-columns:1fr}.arr{transform:rotate(90deg);justify-self:center}section{padding:64px 0}}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){html{scroll-behavior:auto}*{transition:none!important}.js .rv{opacity:1;transform:none}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header class="top">
<a class="logo" href="#home">VS<span>.</span></a>
<div class="fx" aria-hidden="true"><i>fx</i><code id="fx">=GOTO("home")</code></div>
<nav><a href="#about">About</a><a href="#skills">Skills</a><a href="#projects">Projects</a><a href="#contact">Contact</a></nav>
</header>

<main>
<section id="home" class="wrap hero">
<div>
<h1>Vipin<br>Shastri</h1>
<div class="cell">Data &amp; MIS Professional</div>
<p class="lead">I turn complex raw datasets into KPI dashboards and reports that management can act on, using Excel, SQL and Power BI, and I automate anything that repeats.</p>
<a class="btn" href="#projects">See my projects</a><a class="btn ghost" href="#contact">Contact me</a>
</div>
<div class="sheet" id="sheet" aria-hidden="true">
<div class="r sh"><span>Region</span><span>Sales</span></div>
<div class="r"><span>North</span><b style="--w:86%"></b></div>
<div class="r"><span>South</span><b style="--w:64%;transition-delay:.15s"></b></div>
<div class="r"><span>East</span><b style="--w:92%;transition-delay:.3s"></b></div>
<div class="r"><span>West</span><b style="--w:48%;transition-delay:.45s"></b></div>
<div class="r"><span>Central</span><b style="--w:71%;transition-delay:.6s"></b></div>
