<p class="host rv">Power BI dashboards are showcased on <a href="https://www.novypro.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">NovyPro</a>. SQL queries, Python scripts and documentation live on <a href="https://github.com/VipinShastri" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>.</p>
