<section id="contact" class="wrap contact">
<h2 class="rv">Have data that needs to make sense?</h2>
<div class="rv">
<p>Reporting, dashboards, automation. Send me a note.</p>
<a class="mail" href="mailto:ogvipinshastri@gmail.com">ogvipinshastri@gmail.com</a>
